 "quotes": [
  {
   "id": "v_q_barkley",
   "t": 71.63,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "zh": "我就批评这一点，老兄，你们根本投不进啊",
     "en": "That's my criticism. Like, damn, dude, you ain't making them.",
     "a": 0.2,
     "b": 3.4
    },
    {
     "zh": "领先 20 分，根本没理由连着投八九个三分",
     "en": "There's never a reason to shoot eight or nine in a row when you got a 20-point lead.",
     "a": 4.3,
     "b": 7.9
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v_q_q3_1",
   "t": 155.96,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "zh": "防守上，我们就是做得更狠、坚持得更久，",
     "en": "Defensively, we just did it harder for longer stretches,",
     "a": 0.1,
     "b": 5.32
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v_q_q4_2",
   "t": 244.753,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "zh": "可能他是想突破，",
     "en": "Maybe he was going to drive",
     "a": 5.59,
     "b": 7.15
    },
    {
     "zh": "想一直运着球，把时间耗完。",
     "en": "and wanted to keep the dribble to run out the clock.",
     "a": 7.15,
     "b": 10.75
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v_q_q5_1",
   "t": 315.79,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "zh": "我觉得接下来只有两条路。",
     "en": "I think it's going to go one of two ways.",
     "a": 1.26,
     "b": 2.52
    },
    {
     "zh": "两条路，一条坏的，一条好的。",
     "en": "One of two ways, and a bad one and a good one.",
     "a": 4.02,
     "b": 6.66
    },
    {
     "zh": "坏的那条，是就此放弃；",
     "en": "And I know the bad one would be giving up,",
     "a": 6.8,
     "b": 9.78
    },
    {
     "zh": "好的那条，是经历这一场，变得更强、更抱团。",
     "en": "the good one would be getting stronger through this, getting more together.",
     "a": 9.94,
     "b": 12.96
    },
    {
     "zh": "我知道，我们会走好的那条路。",
     "en": "And I know this is what we're going to do.",
     "a": 13.16,
     "b": 14.38
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
